#: pop3.cc:249
msgid "PASS <your password>"
msgstr "PASS <sersüzeñ>"

#: pop3.cc:252
msgid "The server said: \"%1\""
msgstr "Server bolay di: \"%1\""

#: pop3.cc:274
msgid "The server terminated the connection."
msgstr "Server bu totaşunı özde."

#: pop3.cc:276
msgid ""
"Invalid response from server:\n"
"\"%1\""
msgstr ""
"Server cawabı yaraqsız :\n"
"\"%1\""

#: pop3.cc:305
msgid ""
"Could not send to server.\n"
msgstr ""
"Servergä cibärep bulmadı.\n"

#: pop3.cc:360 pop3.cc:419 pop3.cc:616
msgid "No authentication details supplied."
msgstr "Tanıtu beleme birelmäde."

#: pop3.cc:397
msgid ""
"Login via APOP failed. The server %1 may not support APOP, although it claims "
"to support it, or the password may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"APOP aşa kerü uzmadı. %1 digän serverdä APOP totuınıñ bulmawı bar, totam dip "
"äytkän bulsa da, yä ki sersüz kileşmäde.\n"
"\n"
"%2"

#: pop3.cc:585
msgid ""
"Login via SASL (%1) failed. The server may not support %2, or the password may "
"be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%3"
msgstr ""
"SASL (%1) aşa kerü uzmadı. Bu serverdä %2 totıluınıñ bulmawı bar, yä ki sersüz "
"kileşmäde.\n"
"\n"
"%3"

#: pop3.cc:594
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support SASL.\n"
"Choose a different authentication method."
msgstr ""
"Bu POP3-server SASL propokolın totmí.\n"
"Tanılu ısulınıñ başqasın saylap bula."

#: pop3.cc:602
msgid "SASL authentication is not compiled into kio_pop3."
msgstr "kio_pop3 cíılğanda SASL-tanılu östälenmägän."

#: pop3.cc:634 pop3.cc:683
msgid ""
"Could not login to %1.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"%1 belän kereşü uzmadı.\n"
"\n"

#: pop3.cc:648
msgid ""
"Could not login to %1. The password may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"%1 belän kereşü uzmadı. Sersüzneñ yalğış buluı bar.\n"
"\n"
"%2"

#: pop3.cc:686
msgid "The server terminated the connection immediately."
msgstr "Server bu totaşunı şunda uq özep tä quydı."

#: pop3.cc:687
msgid ""
"Server does not respond properly:\n"
"%1\n"
msgstr ""
"Server tieşleçä cawapnı birmi:\n"
"%1\n"

#: pop3.cc:715
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support APOP.\n"
"Choose a different authentication method."
msgstr ""
"Bu POP3-server APOP propokolın totmí.\n"
"Tanılu ısulınıñ başqasın saylap bula."

#: pop3.cc:735
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server claims to support TLS but negotiation was unsuccessful. You "
"can disable TLS in KDE using the crypto settings module."
msgstr ""
"Bu POP3-server TLS protokolın totqan kebek bulsa da, anıñ aşa aralasıp "
"bulmadı.\n"
"KDE'neñ serläw caylaw modulı aşa TLS qullanuın sünderep bula."

#: pop3.cc:746
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support TLS. Disable TLS, if you want to connect "
"without encryption."
msgstr ""
"Bu POP3-server TLS protokolın totmí. Serläwsez totaşası kilsä, TLS protokolın "
"sünderep bula."

#: pop3.cc:755
msgid "Username and password for your POP3 account:"
msgstr "POP3 xísabıña ireşü adı belän sersüz:"

#: pop3.cc:955 pop3.cc:964 pop3.cc:1103
msgid "Unexpected response from POP3 server."
msgstr "POP3 server yağınnan kötelmägän cawap kilde."
